    "sampleDesign.markdownParagraph": {
      "comment": "Copy for the redesigned built-in sample documents.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A reading habit starts with a little space, not a bigger goal. Keep a book nearby and make the first step easy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "养成阅读习惯，先从给生活留一点空隙开始。把书放在手边，让翻开第一页变得容易。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "養成閱讀習慣，先從給生活留一點空隙開始。把書放在手邊，讓翻開第一頁變得容易。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "読書の習慣は、大きな目標よりも小さな余白から。手の届くところに本を置いて、最初の一歩を軽くする。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "sampleDesign.markdownBulletOne": {
      "comment": "Copy for the redesigned built-in sample documents.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Start small.** Ten quiet minutes can change the pace of a day."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**从一点点开始。** 安静的十分钟，就能让一天慢下来。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**從一點點開始。** 安靜的十分鐘，就能讓一天慢下來。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**少しずつ始める。** 静かな10分が、一日のリズムを変えてくれる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
